{"5132560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Late Stage Gambling", "steam_appid": 5132560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BET BEFORE YOU FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before every round you choose how much to risk. Low stakes, safe payout. High stakes, better weapons and buffs, and a much worse penalty when you go down. Nobody makes you bet, though. We respect your free will (Punishments may apply).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/f5adc73902126853c8b78c8c37be974d.poster.avif?t=1788129858\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/f5adc73902126853c8b78c8c37be974d.webm?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/f5adc73902126853c8b78c8c37be974d.mp4?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOOT, STAB, GAMBLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down action against 10 enemy types and one mini boss, each one of them willing to tear you apart just to pay their own debts. With over 42 guns, 20 melee weapons, 30 buffs, 25 consumables and lots of chips, there is no shortage of options to defend yourself. Though, what you can bring with you depends on what you are willing to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/77d748090e6c00bc481e502b4d60ed45.poster.avif?t=1788129858\" width=1142 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/77d748090e6c00bc481e502b4d60ed45.webm?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/77d748090e6c00bc481e502b4d60ed45.mp4?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOP TEN BIGGEST DEBTORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere, there's a list of the ten biggest debtors on Earth, filled with the names of gambling addicts, killers, victims of the system, and people who want to end the cycle of bloodshed using even more bloodshed. Your name is John Gambling. And you are the biggest debtor in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The list belongs to System, a strange woman who owns all the money there is in the world.  Every debt in every country is owed to the same person, and the ten people who owe the most have been invited against their will to a casino-coliseum to pay it off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/0d3b18c959dd7d2d5c22f4f544f1d208.poster.avif?t=1788129858\" width=1144 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/0d3b18c959dd7d2d5c22f4f544f1d208.webm?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/0d3b18c959dd7d2d5c22f4f544f1d208.mp4?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERYONE DOWN THERE OWES SOMETHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>There's a price on your head, and it's exactly large enough to clear the debt of whoever collects it. People from six factions come into the arena, and each one of them is fighting for the same reason you are, to pay their debts with other people's blood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to be honest. In the end, no one really cares about paying their debts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood is money. And money means one more bet on 19. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available languages: English. Spanish.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BET BEFORE YOU FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before every round you choose how much to risk. Low stakes, safe payout. High stakes, better weapons and buffs, and a much worse penalty when you go down. Nobody makes you bet, though. We respect your free will (Punishments may apply).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/f5adc73902126853c8b78c8c37be974d.poster.avif?t=1788129858\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/f5adc73902126853c8b78c8c37be974d.webm?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/f5adc73902126853c8b78c8c37be974d.mp4?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOOT, STAB, GAMBLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down action against 10 enemy types and one mini boss, each one of them willing to tear you apart just to pay their own debts. With over 42 guns, 20 melee weapons, 30 buffs, 25 consumables and lots of chips, there is no shortage of options to defend yourself. Though, what you can bring with you depends on what you are willing to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/77d748090e6c00bc481e502b4d60ed45.poster.avif?t=1788129858\" width=1142 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/77d748090e6c00bc481e502b4d60ed45.webm?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/77d748090e6c00bc481e502b4d60ed45.mp4?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOP TEN BIGGEST DEBTORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere, there's a list of the ten biggest debtors on Earth, filled with the names of gambling addicts, killers, victims of the system, and people who want to end the cycle of bloodshed using even more bloodshed. Your name is John Gambling. And you are the biggest debtor in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The list belongs to System, a strange woman who owns all the money there is in the world.  Every debt in every country is owed to the same person, and the ten people who owe the most have been invited against their will to a casino-coliseum to pay it off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/0d3b18c959dd7d2d5c22f4f544f1d208.poster.avif?t=1788129858\" width=1144 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/0d3b18c959dd7d2d5c22f4f544f1d208.webm?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/extras/0d3b18c959dd7d2d5c22f4f544f1d208.mp4?t=1788129858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERYONE DOWN THERE OWES SOMETHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>There's a price on your head, and it's exactly large enough to clear the debt of whoever collects it. People from six factions come into the arena, and each one of them is fighting for the same reason you are, to pay their debts with other people's blood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to be honest. In the end, no one really cares about paying their debts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood is money. And money means one more bet on 19. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available languages: English. Spanish.</p>", "short_description": "Here you don't pick up loot. You bet for it. This is a push your luck top-down shooter roguelike. Gamble every round, the riskier the wager, the better your gear and the worse it hurts when you lose. Shoot and gamble through the waves of a casino-coliseum to pay off a debt impossible to calculate.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/1738701998696f2d363095dcb0a98c8dcb66db5d/header.jpg?t=1788129858", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/a7ca9d439ffdaf6c4c585c42db06ab775f86efd2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788129858", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5132560/a7ca9d439ffdaf6c4c585c42db06ab775f86efd2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788129858", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum":